{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/841217-2ed-some-homebrew-devotions","id":841217,"title":"[2ED] Some homebrew devotions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-03T04:22:20-08:00","id":841217,"title":"[2ED] Some homebrew devotions","content":"Hi all,<br /> in order to insert some particular NPC in my game, I created some devotions and I would like to have your opinions and tips.<br /> If you have any suggestions even on names and not just on the mechanical part it would be appreciated.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Silent Command</u></b><br /> (Dominate 3, Auspex 4)<br /> With this power the Kindred is able to impress his command directly in the mind of the target.<br /> <b><u>Cost:</u></b> 1 Vitae<br /> <b><u>Roll:</u></b> Intelligence + Socialize + Auspex vs. Resolve + Blood Potency<br /> <b><u>Action:</u></b> Instant<br /> <b><u>Duration:</u></b> A scene<br /> After managing to inflict the Mesmerized Condition, the kindred can, spending a vitae point, impress his will directly in the mind of the victim without having to speak or maintaining the eye contact (which in any case must be established to impress the mesmerized condition at the beginning).<br /> This Devotion costs 3 Experience Point.<br /> <br /> <b><i><u>Instant Command</u></i></b><br /> (Dominate 2, Celerity 1)<br /> With a simple glance, intercepting the victim\u2019s eyes for just a short moment, the vampire can impress his will on him.<br /> <b><u>Cost:</u></b> 1 Vitae<br /> <b><u>Roll:</u></b> None (those due for the normal use of Dominate)<br /> <b><u>Action:</u></b> Reflexive<br /> With this power vampire can impress his command in the same turn in which he impress Mesmerized Condition.<br /> This Devotion costs 1 Experience Point.<br /> <br /> <b><i><u>Spirit Body</u></i></b><br /> (Auspex 5, Vigor 1)<br /> While the kindred is in astral form, he may decides to make himself visible at one or more observer at his own choice, communicating with them as if he were a spooky event. He can also interact with physical world and object using intelligence in place of strength as the only attribute (he can\u2019t sums skills).<br /> <b><u>Cost:</u></b> 1 + Vitae<br /> <b><u>Roll:</u></b> None / Intelligence to interact with physical matter<br /> <b><u>Action:</u></b> Instant<br /> <b><u>Duration:</u></b> A Scene<br /> He can communicate with anyone who has faced while he is in astral form without any roll and with just the expenditure of one Vitae. He\u2019ll appears as a spooky and translucent figure not bound to gravity. He can also interact with object and physical bodies spending an additional point of vitae for each action, using the only intelligence attribute.<br /> This devotion costs 3 Experience Points.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-03T06:19:38-08:00","id":841257,"title":"","content":"I'd make Spirit Body cross with Nightmare, as that one creates illusions","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-